I can confess too

556
00:43:51.358 --> 00:43:54.194
My husband Jang Jun-ik
I killed it with my own hands

557
00:43:54.862 --> 00:43:55.696
Then

558
00:43:56.363 --> 00:43:58.866
hidden all over the world
All the money in Mr. Junik’s account is

559
00:43:59.783 --> 00:44:01.243
It will belong to your mother and master.

560
00:44:15.424 --> 00:44:16.258
How do you feel?

561
00:44:26.018 --> 00:44:27.060
teacher

562
00:44:28.228 --> 00:44:29.479
Leave your legs alone

